 be both memorable and restorative, start comparing **Hotels Near Tumpak Sewu** now—and choose the stay that lets the waterfall become part of the experience, not just the destination.\n','[{\"id\":1,\"isFeatured\":false,\"imageUrl\":\"uploads\\/img_1789693825500_6v7u2b.jpeg\",\"location\":\"kaliningrad cottage\",\"scene\":\"tipe kamar dengan latar belakang bukit\",\"altText\":\"A modern A-frame cottage in Kaliningrad with a glass front, outdoor seating, and hillside views in the background.\",\"title\":\"A-Frame Cottage in Kaliningrad with Hillside Backdrop\",\"caption\":\"A stylish A-frame cottage in Kaliningrad featuring a glass facade, cozy outdoor seating, and scenic hillside surroundings.\",\"description\":\"This image shows a modern A-frame cottage in Kaliningrad with a large glass front, small outdoor table and chairs, and a hillside backdrop. The compact design and scenic setting make it an appealing stay for travelers seeking a unique countryside retreat.\",\"fileName\":\"kaliningrad-a-frame-cottage-hillside-view.jpg\"},{\"id\":2,\"isFeatured\":false,\"imageUrl\":\"uploads\\/img_1789693912449_04zx0p.jpeg\",\"location\":\"sambas cottage\",\"scene\":\"view hotel sambas dari atas di malam hari\",\"altText\":\"Aerial night view of Sambas Cottage hotel with illuminated rooftops and landscaped courtyard\",\"title\":\"Aerial Night View of Sambas Cottage Hotel\",\"caption\":\"Sambas Cottage hotel seen from above at night, featuring glowing architecture and a landscaped central walkway.\",\"description\":\"An aerial nighttime view of Sambas Cottage hotel, showcasing its illuminated rooflines, symmetrical layout, and landscaped courtyard from above. The scene highlights the property\\u2019s modern design and warm lighting against the dark night sky.\",\"fileName\":\"sambas-cottage-hotel-aerial-night-view.jpg\"},{\"id\":3,\"isFeatured\":false,\"imageUrl\":\"uploads\\/img_1789693966974_o17rtx.jpeg\",\"location\":\"yanto homestay\",\"scene\":\"tipe kamar standart di ya